{"request":{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are Larry, the camera operator. You've got one charged recording. The lights at the festival look spectacular; an old projectionist also wants to say a few words. You decide what to shoot and what to do after work. Pick an immediate physical act you can carry out, optional words and a practical intention. Your words do not make anyone else act. Silence is allowed. You may refuse, tell a lie, or leave without explaining yourself. Return action, words, intention and detail. Use a listed action exactly. Keep each other field to one short sentence."},{"role":"user","content":"{\n \"what_you_observe\": [\n  \"The post tray is empty. No signed reply has arrived.\",\n  \"Seven pm. You have one evening stop.\",\n  \"Phil said in the lobby: Stay in the hotel lobby. The afternoon is yours.\",\n  \"Rita said in the lobby: Go to the ballroom to arrange tonight's party. The afternoon is yours. The stranded driver, ballroom piano, paid coach and crew return-fare envelope are here again.\",\n  \"Rita gets the ballroom ready for the evening.\",\n  \"Larry uses the battery for the party rehearsal. The reel stays with him.\",\n  \"You are now at ballroom.\"\n ],\n \"your_own_prior_receipts\": [],\n \"physical_choices\": {\n  \"go_home\": \"Clock off and go home.\",\n  \"deliver_reel\": \"Bring your recording to the station patch for Rita.\",\n  \"screen_party\": \"Show the festival footage at the ballroom if you have it.\"\n }\n}"}],"think":false,"stream":true,"format":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["go_home","deliver_reel","screen_party"]},"words":{"type":"string"},"intention":{"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"required":["action","words","intention","detail"],"additionalProperties":false},"keep_alive":"90s","options":{"num_ctx":4096,"num_predict":240,"temperature":0.8,"seed":2148513}},"chunks":[{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:26:06.423295Z","m